  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fatii1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_5d0091c0-57d5-4bc5-8592-ca850b88254c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"102\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/T4xFVm8kct\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/964608/description_88829ca5-d813-4ded-b021-30cf3a70da2c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"104\"></a><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1335768/description_2ce64368-aaa3-4de0-87ae-ff63766edbdb.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"><br>這個模組完全取代並重新設計了Minecraft的女巫小屋，將其改建成以中世紀建築為靈感的神祕城堡與高塔。<em>所有結構完全使用原版方塊搭建，</em><em>不包含任何自訂方塊或實體。</em><strong><br>（歡迎自由加入任何模組包）&nbsp;<br><br></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1335768/description_ffeff1da-8cf2-4fb3-9918-3102c80d3051.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p><p>🆕 <strong>計劃中：更好的世界融合與更多變化<br></strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1335768/description_0206090d-d8ec-43a9-bcb0-30519708b19c.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p><p>正在開發中的模組列表：</p><p>✅ 史詩村莊<br>✅ 史詩女巫小屋<br>✅ 史詩地牢<br>✅ 史詩冰屋&nbsp;<br>🟨 史詩叢林神廟</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1335768/description_5d2e4f23-65c5-4e52-91b3-8230962cff73.jpg\" width=\"850\" height=\"60\"></p><p><strong>- ✅ </strong>完全相容<strong> Terralith</strong><br><strong>- ✅ </strong>完全相容 <strong>Regions Unexplored</strong><br><strong>- ✅ </strong>完全相容<strong> Tectonic</strong><br><strong>- ✅ </strong>完全相容 <strong>Oh the Biomes We've Gone</strong><br><strong>- ✅ </strong>完全相容 <strong>Biomes O' Plenty</strong><br><strong>- ✅</strong> 完全相容<strong> Geophilic</strong><br><strong>- </strong>✅ 完全相容 <strong>William Wythers’ Overhauled Overworld&nbsp;</strong><br><strong>- ✅ </strong>完全相容 <strong>William Wythers’ Expanded Ecosphere</strong><br><br><br></p>",
